# Baron fight uses rendered bar telemetry and a carried launcher

The [[Gold Rush]] Baron repair distinguishes the source HP ratio from the actual rendered fill ratio. The world bar now exposes both, and its eight dividers extinguish as HP sections are spent, so a test cannot pass by recomputing source state while the visible mesh is wrong.

The rocket-cart mechanics, defeat capture, and Sky-Rocket Battery gate remain intact, but the visible wheeled trailer was removed. The brass rocket rack and teal telegraph are carried on the Baron's back.

The e1-only tuning is HP 240, contact 5, building 16, support-building 12, pursuit range 18. The shorter pursuit range is essential: 45 kept the hero dominant as a target across most of the claim and suppressed the intended building-wrecker behavior.

Gotcha: `e2e/054-baron-epic.spec.ts` hard-codes the previous manifest numbers while its task requires it remain unmodified. It must be reconciled by the orchestrator when draining the new ruling.

